Z||000000||Gokart||02-13-2000||09:58 PM||||Removed plenum for repaint today and after I pulled it off I unbolted the EGR tube and could not believe the amount of built up dirt and schmeg in the hole surrounding around the gasket. It had built up so much that the hole was almost totally blocked off! It was so hard I actually had to break it off in pieces like a small rock. Glad I found this now and not later! Just thought I'd share this find so if anyone pulls their plenum, remove tube and clean out openings where tube connects!!<p>[This message has been edited by Gokart (edited 02-13-2000).]||||reg||4
